{
    "title": "PedidosYa - Delivery Online",
    "description": "<b>Today more than ever, ask me for whatever you want </b>\r\n\r\nWhen you have a wish that can't wait, you don't ask a falling star, you ask PedidosYa.\r\n\r\n<h1>Order online from the best restaurants, supermarket chains, pharmacies, stores</h1>, and much more! Find, order and receive what you want easily at PedidosYa.\r\n\r\n<b>Do you want it? You got it!</b>\r\n- Explore and filter the best places with <h1>delivery in your area</h1>\r\n- Repeat your orders easily\r\n- Take advantage of exclusive discounts and promotions\r\n- Read, comment and write opinions about businesses\r\n\r\n<b>Let's fly!</b>\r\n- Customize your order\r\n- Select your favorite products\r\n- Schedule the delivery of your <h1>order</h1>\r\n- Choose from a variety of payment methods\r\n\r\n<b>We'll take it to you wherever you are!</b>\r\n- Stay updated with the status of your order\r\n- Follow the journey of your order live\r\n- Consult our online help if you need it\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are in Argentina, Bolivia, Chile, Paraguay, the Dominican Republic or Uruguay, we fly for you and make your life easier by carrying whatever you order in minutes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Today more than ever, ask me for whatever you want </b><br><br>When you have a wish that can&#39;t wait, you don&#39;t ask a falling star, you ask PedidosYa.<br><br><h1>Order online from the best restaurants, supermarket chains, pharmacies, stores</h1>, and much more! Find, order and receive what you want easily at PedidosYa.<br><br><b>Do you want it? You got it!</b><br>- Explore and filter the best places with <h1>delivery in your area</h1><br>- Repeat your orders easily<br>- Take advantage of exclusive discounts and promotions<br>- Read, comment and write opinions about businesses<br><br><b>Let&#39;s fly!</b><br>- Customize your order<br>- Select your favorite products<br>- Schedule the delivery of your <h1>order</h1><br>- Choose from a variety of payment methods<br><br><b>We&#39;ll take it to you wherever you are!</b><br>- Stay updated with the status of your order<br>- Follow the journey of your order live<br>- Consult our online help if you need it<br><br><br>If you are in Argentina, Bolivia, Chile, Paraguay, the Dominican Republic or Uruguay, we fly for you and make your life easier by carrying whatever you order in minutes.",
